    context: "A workshop owns the tool set $W = \\{\\text{hammer}, \\text{saw}, \\text{level}, \\text{pliers}\\}$. The mobile kit is $K = \\{\\text{hammer}, \\text{pliers}\\}$, and the measuring kit is $M = \\{\\text{level}\\}$.",
