      "**D) If R were false instead, then P would have to be false too.**  (true)\n\nIf R were false, then $Q \\Leftrightarrow R$ would force Q false, and then $P \\Leftrightarrow Q$ would force P false - tracing the chain backward.\n\nThe claim matches the computation above, so it is **true**.",
